{"path":"chrono/duration/operator_arith2","title":"std::chrono::duration<Rep,Period>::operator++, std::chrono::duration<Rep,Period>::operator--","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::chrono::duration&lt;Rep,Period&gt;::</span>operator++, <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::chrono::duration&lt;Rep,Period&gt;::</span>operator--","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/chrono/duration/operator_arith2","section":"chrono","kind":"page","summary":"Increments or decrements the number of ticks for this duration.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">duration<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy2\">++</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(constexpr since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">duration operator<span class=\"sy2\">++</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(constexpr since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_3\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">duration<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy2\">--</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (3) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(constexpr since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_4\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">duration operator<span class=\"sy2\">--</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (4) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(constexpr since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Increments or decrements the number of ticks for this duration.\n</p><p>If <code>rep_</code> is a member variable holding the number of ticks in a duration object, \n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">++</span>rep_<span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">return</span> duration<span class=\"br0\">(</span>rep_<span class=\"sy2\">++</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">3)</span> Equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">--</span>rep_<span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">4)</span> Equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">return</span> duration<span class=\"br0\">(</span>rep_<span class=\"sy2\">--</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1,3)</span> A reference to this duration after modification.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2,4)</span> A copy of the duration made before modification.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;chrono&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration\"><span class=\"kw1003\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">hours</span></span></a> h<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration\"><span class=\"kw1002\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">minutes</span></span></a> m <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"sy2\">++</span>h<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    m<span class=\"sy2\">--</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> m.<span class=\"me1\">count</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" minutes<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>119 minutes</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration/operator_arith3\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator+=</span><span>operator-=</span><span>operator*=</span><span>operator/=</span><span>operator%=</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  implements compound assignment between two durations <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration/operator_arith4\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator+</span><span>operator-</span><span>operator*</span><span>operator/</span><span>operator%</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  implements arithmetic operations with durations as arguments <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"chrono","title":"Date and time utilities"},{"path":"chrono/duration","title":"std::chrono::duration"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::chrono::duration<Rep,Period>::operator++, std::chrono::duration<Rep,Period>::operator--","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"4 declarations; revisions: since C++11. Increments or decrements the number of ticks for this duration."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"A reference to this duration after modification."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"operator+=, operator-=, operator*=, …","note":"implements compound assignment between two durations"},{"label":"operator+, operator-, operator*, …","note":"implements arithmetic operations with durations as arguments"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++17"],"wordCount":151,"codeBlockCount":2}
